# Check out LF on every platform.
#
# The pipeline writes LF. With Windows' core.autocrlf=true git would check files
# out as CRLF, and the next run would rewrite every one of them — showing as
# "modified" with no content change at all. Pinning eol=lf keeps a re-run after an
# unchanged app byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf
